{
  "version": 1,
  "board": "arduino:avr:uno",
  "control_period_ms": 10,
  "planning_notes": [
    "D7 上连接的是 DHT11 温湿度传感器；本配置仅为“温度值”创建传感端口与对应串口输出。",
    "串口输出触发条件：使用 SysML/模型逻辑基于 elapsed_ms 实现“每秒输出一次”，因此该触发器在 serial_channels.trigger 中表达为业务条件。",
    "serial_channels 使用与输入相同的物理 Serial 波特率 9600；帧格式继承 line_or_idle 且 idle_timeout_ms=20（由系统串口默认配置处理）。",
    "若原需求还要求湿度输出，则需额外再增加 dht_humidity 与对应的串口 value/触发器；当前仅包含温度部分。"
  ],
  "interfaces": [
    {
      "name": "io_0",
      "direction": "input",
      "type": "f64",
      "unit": "degC",
      "initial": 0,
      "meaning": "DHT11 temperature value from D7",
      "sample_period_ms": 2000,
      "device": "dht_temperature",
      "hardware": "{\"invalid_policy\": \"hold_last_valid\", \"kind\": \"dht_temperature\", \"pin\": \"D7\", \"sensor\": \"DHT11\"}",
      "binding": {
        "kind": "dht_temperature",
        "invalid_policy": "hold_last_valid",
        "pin": "D7",
        "sensor": "DHT11"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "io_1",
      "direction": "input",
      "type": "i32",
      "unit": "ms",
      "initial": 0,
      "meaning": "Actual delta since previous control step",
      "sample_period_ms": 10,
      "device": "elapsed_ms",
      "hardware": "{\"kind\": \"elapsed_ms\", \"semantics\": \"delta_since_previous_step\"}",
      "binding": {
        "kind": "elapsed_ms",
        "semantics": "delta_since_previous_step"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "serial_0_trigger",
      "direction": "output",
      "type": "bool",
      "unit": "1",
      "initial": false,
      "meaning": "每秒通过串口输出一次温度值",
      "sample_period_ms": 10,
      "device": "Serial report control",
      "hardware": "{\"kind\": \"report_trigger\"}",
      "binding": {
        "kind": "report_trigger"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "serial_0_value_0",
      "direction": "output",
      "type": "f64",
      "unit": "degC",
      "initial": 0.0,
      "meaning": "DHT11温度(摄氏度)当前值",
      "sample_period_ms": 10,
      "device": "Serial value",
      "hardware": "{\"baud\": 9600, \"kind\": \"serial_value\", \"label\": \"temperature\", \"trigger\": \"serial_0_trigger\"}",
      "binding": {
        "kind": "serial_value",
        "trigger": "serial_0_trigger",
        "baud": 9600,
        "label": "temperature"
      }
    }
  ],
